	//   - a block index dimension 'I' (tile number)
	//   - a per-tile index 'i'
	//   - a guard dimension 'g' to handle a potentially partial last tile
	//
	// We then hoist 'I' to the top, so the traversal order becomes:
	//   time t  ->  tile I  ->  points i within that tile
